        {
          "text": "Abakuru b’ingabo z’Abafilisitiya bashishikara gutera Isirayeli, kandi igihe cose batera, Dawidi yama abanesha akarusha abandi bakuru b’ingabo bose ba Sawuli, maze izina ryiwe riba rurangiranwa.",
